    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. TEFLON RING FOR CONTROL VALVE"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) Remove the teflon rings."
    },
    {
      "type": "caution",
      "text": "Be careful not to damage the control valve."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Installing new teflon ring to SST and control valve",
      "labels": [
        "SST",
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 22,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 19
      },
      "diagram_id": "ZV647-95M02"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Install a new teflon ring to SST and install it to the control valve."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09630-24013 (09631-24020)",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) Coat the teflon ring with power steering fluid and snug it down with your fingers."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Sliding tapered end of SST over teflon ring to seat the ring",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 42,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 18
      },
      "diagram_id": "9P0081"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(d) Carefully slide the tapered end of the SST over the teflon ring to seat the ring."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09630-24013 (09631-24030)",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Using SST to press out oil seal and bearing from valve cap",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 61,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "7. OIL SEAL AND BEARING FOR VALVE CAP"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) Using SST, press out the oil seal and bearing from the valve cap."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09620-30010 (09631-00020)",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "",
      "number": "09630-24013 (09620-24010)",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Using SST to press oil seal into valve cap",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 79,
        "left": 1,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Using SST, press the oil seal into the valve cap."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09620-30010 (09631-00020)",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
